{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"DAN","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"但以理书","commonName":"但以理书","title":"但以理书","order":27,"numberOfChapters":12,"sha256":"d427dd5f82fad6c3af92d51026e123404a93fefe2dfb66f20cd5e77f7f603ad8","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/DAN/1.json","lastChapterNumber":12,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/DAN/12.json","totalNumberOfVerses":357},"chapter":{"number":12,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["末日"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["「那时，保佑你本国之民的天使长",{"noteId":32},"米迦勒必站起来，并且有大艰难，从有国以来直到此时，没有这样的。你本国的民中，凡名录在册上的，必得拯救。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["睡在尘埃中的，必有多人复醒。其中有得永生的，有受羞辱永远被憎恶的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["智慧人必发光如同天上的光；那使多人归义的，必发光如星，直到永永远远。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["但以理啊，你要隐藏这话，封闭这书，直到末时。必有多人来往奔跑",{"noteId":33},"，知识就必增长。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["我—但以理观看，见另有两个人站立：一个在河这边，一个在河那边。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["有一个问那站在河水以上、穿细麻衣的说：「这奇异的事到几时才应验呢？」"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["我听见那站在河水以上、穿细麻衣的，向天举起左右手，指着活到永远的主起誓说：「要到一载、二载、半载，打破圣民权力的时候，这一切事就都应验了。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["我听见这话，却不明白，就说：「我主啊，这些事的结局是怎样呢？」"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["他说：「但以理啊，你只管去；因为这话已经隐藏封闭，直到末时。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["必有许多人使自己清净洁白，且被熬炼；但恶人仍必行恶，一切恶人都不明白，惟独智慧人能明白。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["从除掉常献的燔祭，并设立那行毁坏可憎之物的时候，必有一千二百九十日。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["等到一千三百三十五日的，那人便为有福。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["「你且去等候结局，因为你必安歇。到了末期，你必起来，享受你的福分。」"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":32,"caller":"-","text":"原文是大君","reference":{"chapter":12,"verse":1}},{"noteId":33,"caller":"-","text":"或译：切心研究","reference":{"chapter":12,"verse":4}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/DAN/12.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/HOS/1.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/DAN/11.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":13}